    {
      "inMain": true,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "We tested six cordless stick vacuums from £149 to £499 in our lab and in three real homes. Each one cleaned the same carpet, hard floor and stairs, and we measured the run time from a full battery.",
      "zone": "article"
    },
    {
      "inMain": true,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "The Tervo V9 picked up the most dust on carpet and ran for 48 minutes in normal mode. At £279 it is not the cheapest, but it beat two models that cost more than £400.",
      "zone": "article"
